    <!--
      ★R8 The customer this guest belongs to, frozen when they were put forward. All
      read-only: it is a snapshot, and hand-editing it would make it a claim rather than
      a record. Blank throughout for a guest who is nobody's customer, which is a state
      worth being able to see at a glance rather than an error.
    -->
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>false</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>false</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Customer</label>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Account__c</field></layoutItems>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Cust_Cd__c</field></layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Account_Manager__c</field></layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <!--
      ★R9 The chain, in its own section rather than one Approver field among the timestamps.
      Five lookups and two numbers is too much to read as a detail; as a section it answers
      the question an AM actually asks of this page — "who still has to say yes, and where
      has it got to?" — in one glance. Levels 4 and 5 are shown even though nothing populates
      them today: a blank level is how this page says the chain ended, and hiding them would
      make a three-level chain and a five-level one look identical.

      The Approval History related list below is the audit trail and this section is the
      forecast. They are not the same thing: history says who has decided, the chain says who
      is still to.
    -->
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>false</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>false</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Approval Chain</label>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Approver_1__c</field></layoutItems>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Approver_2__c</field></layoutItems>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Approver_3__c</field></layoutItems>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Approver_4__c</field></layoutItems>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Approver_5__c</field></layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Current_Level__c</field></layoutItems>
            <layoutItems><behavior>Readonly</behavior><field>Approval_Levels__c</field></layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <relatedLists>
        <relatedList>RelatedProcessHistoryList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
</Layout>
